    "description": "JobAI backend API collection for local and preview testing.\n\nBase URL defaults to `http://localhost:5001/api/v1`. Authentication endpoints include login, LinkedIn OAuth, and the JOB-102 password reset flow.\n\nFor password reset testing, run **Auth / Password Reset / Request Password Reset**, retrieve the token from the email, set the `password_reset_token` collection variable, then run **Reset Password**.",
