                  "raw": "/*{\n    \"bio\": \"Product-oriented Software Engineer with 10+ years of experience designing, building, and scaling web platforms across diverse domains, now pivoting toward the development of GenAI-powered products. My background spans full-stack engineering, APIs, cloud infrastructure, and clean system design, which I now leverage to build applied AI solutions rather than isolated prototypes. I focus on Python (FastAPI), modular and hexagonal architectures, and the implementation of LLM-based systems, including RAG pipelines, multi-agent workflows, and AI-driven automation. My current objective is a deliberate transition toward AI product development, combining long-term engineering expertise with newly acquired and continuously consolidated skills in GenAI, applied machine learning, and MLOps. I am particularly motivated by environments where experimentation meets real-world constraints, and where AI solutions must be robust, traceable, and production-ready from day one.\"\n}*/\n\n{\n    \"current_title\": \"Backend Developer\",\n    \"skills\": [\"python\", \"fastapi\", \"postgresql\"]\n}",
